arm64: configs: salami: regenerate defconfig

From: ynk <evils.ynk@gmail.com>

Regenerate salami_defconfig in savedefconfig form: drop the hand
written section comments and list the effective configuration
explicitly, including options that must stay off (n) against the
generic arm64 defconfig defaults. No intended functional change
compared to the configuration the tree has been building with.

Signed-off-by: ynk <evils.ynk@gmail.com>
